      A←1

      )ERASE OP1
      ]FILE_CTL SKIP_APL2   ⍝ GNU APL-only function header
∇A (LO OP1 RO) B
∇

      )ERASE LL

      )ERASE FOO
      ]FILE_CTL NO_SKIP
∇FOO
LL: ⎕NC 6 3⍴' ÷ ÷  LL A  FOOOP1'
∇

      FOO
¯1 ¯1 1 2 3 4

      ]FILE_CTL SKIP_APL2   ⍝ ⎕NC of GNU APL names/classes differs
      ⎕NC 6 3⍴' ÷ ÷  LL A  FOOOP1'
¯1 ¯1 0 2 3 4

      ⍝ lambda stuff
      ⍝
      ⎕NC ⍪'⎕λ⍺⍶χ⍵⍹'
5 6 6 6 6 6 6

      ⎕NC 6 2⍴ 'λ_⍺_⍶_χ_⍵_⍹_'
¯1 ¯1 ¯1 ¯1 ¯1 ¯1

      ⎕NC '⎕X'
5

      ]FILE_CTL NO_SKIP
      ⎕NC '⎕XX'
¯1

      ]FILE_CTL SKIP_APL2   ⍝ ⎕NC of GNU APL names/classes differs
      ⎕NC'⎕'
